44","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHHB1X5W0K98DAS1BWZ1K3Y","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHHB2XXBMVPCR1MFC43GGD3","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n ぜひぜひ\n 美穂ちゃんの写真集を\n 多くの人に見てもらいたいわ〜\n \n 美穂ちゃん\n ご来店ありがとうございました✨"}],"source":"archive"}